#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:1
msgid "Release 2.6 (2022-01-24)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:3
msgid ""
"The Nix CLI now searches for a `flake.nix` up until the root of the current "
"Git repository or a filesystem boundary rather than just in the current "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:6
msgid ""
"The TOML parser used by `builtins.fromTOML` has been replaced by [a more "
"compliant one](https://github.com/ToruNiina/toml11)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:8
msgid ""
"Added `:st`/`:show-trace` commands to `nix repl`, which are used to set or "
"toggle display of error traces."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:10
msgid ""
"New builtin function `builtins.zipAttrsWith` with the same functionality as "
"`lib.zipAttrsWith` from Nixpkgs, but much more efficient."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:13
msgid ""
"New command `nix store copy-log` to copy build logs from one store to "
"another."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:15
msgid ""
"The `commit-lockfile-summary` option can be set to a non-empty string to "
"override the commit summary used when committing an updated lockfile.  This "
"may be used in conjunction with the `nixConfig` attribute in `flake.nix` to "
"better conform to repository conventions."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.6.md:20
msgid ""
"`docker run -ti nixos/nix:master` will place you in the Docker container "
"with the latest version of Nix from the `master` branch."
msgstr ""
